## solutions

#### recursive

```cpp
#include <algorithm>

int howHigh(Node* root) {
  if (root == nullptr) {
    return -1;
  }

  return 1 + std::max(howHigh(root->left), howHigh(root->right));
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
